     "Ntukubake templates uvanye mu byinjijwe by'umukoresha; ubitange nka variables gusa, ukoreshe template engine ifite sandbox, kandi ugenzure ibyinjijwe. Akenshi bifatwa nk'ikomeye cyane.",
